<title>UK: TABLE-Edinburgh pre-tax up 41 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Edinburgh pre-tax up 41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended January 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr			(pence) 28.1	   vs 45.4</p>
<p> Shr pre-exceptionals (pence) 40.2	   vs 42.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence) 17.0 making 25.0	   vs 25.0</p>
<p> Pretax pre-exceptionals	18.0	   vs 12.8</p>
<p> Pre-tax after exceptionals   12.6	   vs 12.8</p>
<p> Turnover			   31.1	   vs 19.6</p>
<p> Funds under management	7,638	   vs 3,538</p>
<p>Full company name - Edinburgh Fund Managers Group Plc</p>
<p>NOTE: Funds under management doubled following the acquisition of DFM (Holdings) Limited (Dunedin) in March 1996. Pre-tax profit rose 41 percent before exceptional costs of 5.4 million stg related to the acquisition.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +171 542 5887</p>
